# Git workflow

- Default branch is `main`. Keep `main` clean. Agent work lands on a feature branch or worktree, then a PR.
- Do not merge. Do not push `main` or `master`. Do not force-push. Do not `--no-verify`. Exception: a blog catch-up William asked for ends on `main` in the same turn. A hook blocks `git push origin main`. Open a PR and `gh pr merge --squash`. Do not stop on a feature branch.
- Do not `wrangler deploy` or `npm run deploy:manual`. A squash-merge to `main` is the blog deploy.
- Say **ready for review**, never **shipped**, until William confirms `main` is live.
- Never update git config. Never auto-commit unless William asks.
